{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":66,"count":33,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L03-2-03\",\"种\",\"種\",\"种\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你喜歡喝哪種茶？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān hē nǎ zhǒng chá?","english":"What kind of tea do you like?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-03","sourceFront":"種","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A：你要哪種筆？ B：我要鉛筆。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ yào nǎ zhǒng bǐ? B: Wǒ yào qiānbǐ.","english":"A: What kind of pen do you want? B: I want a pencil.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-04","sourceFront":"鉛筆","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"A：這種蛋糕很貴嗎？ B：是啊，這種蛋糕不便宜。","pinyin":"A: Zhè zhǒng dàngāo hěn guì ma? B: Shì ā, zhè zhǒng dàngāo bù piányí.","english":"A: Is this kind of cake expensive? B: Yes, this kind of cake is not cheap.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-12","sourceFront":"便宜","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這種小鉛筆怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng xiǎo qiānbǐ zěnmeyàng?","english":"What do you think about this type of small pencil?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這種飲料很好喝。","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng yǐnliào hěn hǎohē.","english":"This kind of beverage tastes good.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-19","sourceFront":"好喝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們賣很多種飲料。","pinyin":"Tāmen mài hěn duō zhǒng yǐnliào.","english":"They have various kinds of drink.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有啊！他們有很多種冰淇淋。","pinyin":"Yǒu a! Tāmen yǒu hěn duō zhǒng bīngqílín.","english":"Oh, yeah. They have lots of kinds of ice cream.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們下個星期要學第十五課，我剛才先看了一點兒，書上有很多種動物，我覺得很有意思。","pinyin":"Wǒmen xià ge xīngqí yào xué dì shíwǔ kè, wǒ gāngcái xiān kàn le yìdiǎnr, shū shàng yǒu hěn duō zhǒng dòngwù, wǒ juéde hěn yǒuyìsi.","english":"We are going to learn lesson fifteen next week. I previewed a bit earlier just now. There are many kinds of animals in the book; I think it is very interesting.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人用不一樣的動物代表每一年，一共有十二種動物。","pinyin":"Huárén yòng bù yíyàng de dòngwù dàibiǎo měi yì nián, yígòng yǒu shí'èr zhǒng dòngwù.","english":"Chinese use different animals to represent each year, and there are a total of twelve kinds of animals.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L04-1-07\",\"饮料\",\"飲料\",\"饮料\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這種飲料很好喝。","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng yǐnliào hěn hǎohē.","english":"This kind of beverage tastes good.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-19","sourceFront":"好喝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我想喝一點兒飲料。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng hē yìdiǎnr yǐnliào.","english":"I would like to have a little drink.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-11","sourceFront":"（一）點（兒）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這家餐廳賣飲料嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè jiā cāntīng mài yǐnliào ma?","english":"Does this restaurant sell beverage?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-22","sourceFront":"賣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"天氣太熱，我要喝飲料。","pinyin":"Tiānqì tài rè, wǒ yào hē yǐnliào.","english":"The weather is too hot, I want some beverage.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-14","sourceFront":"太","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他們賣很多種飲料。","pinyin":"Tāmen mài hěn duō zhǒng yǐnliào.","english":"They have various kinds of drink.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"天氣好熱，我們去喝飲料，好不好？","pinyin":"Tiānqì hǎo rè, wǒmen qù hē yǐnliào, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"The weather is so hot. How about we go have some drink?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"太好了！我最愛吃牛肉麵。他們也賣飲料嗎？","pinyin":"Tài hǎo le! Wǒ zuì ài chī niúròu miàn. Tāmen yě mài yǐnliào ma?","english":"That is awesome! Beef noodles is my favorite. Do they sell drinks as well?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你很渴嗎？我有一瓶飲料，你要不要喝？","pinyin":"Nǐ hěn kě ma? Wǒ yǒu yì píng yǐnliào, nǐ yào bú yào hē?","english":"Are you thirsty? I have a bottle of beverage, would you like to have some?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-06","sourceFront":"瓶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"台灣夏天的天氣很熱，很多人都喜歡喝飲料。","pinyin":"Táiwān xiàtiān de tiānqì hěn rè, hěn duō rén dōu xǐhuān hē yǐnliào.","english":"During summer the weather is very hot in Taiwan, many people like to have beverages.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-01","sourceFront":"夏天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"那家飲料店的飲料很好喝，我們去那裡買。","pinyin":"Nà jiā yǐnliào diàn de yǐnliào hěn hǎohē, wǒmen qù nàlǐ mǎi.","english":"That beverage store serves great beverages. Let’s go there and get some.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-09","sourceFront":"那裡/那兒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-06\",\"网址\",\"網址\",\"网址\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這是博物館的網址，你可以先看看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-1-06","sourceFront":"網址","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-3-08\",\"输\",\"輸\",\"输\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他跑得很快，如果跟他比賽，我沒有機會贏，一定會輸。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-3-08","sourceFront":"輸","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小畢本來認為自己的書法寫得很好，但是上次比賽輸了以後，他就失去自信了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-14","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場網球比賽打得很激烈，已經打了五個小時了，還不知道誰輸誰贏。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-15","sourceFront":"激烈","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場棒球比賽已打到最後一局，可是仍無法看出誰輸誰贏。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-48","sourceFront":"局","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L16-3-12\",\"游戏\",\"遊戲\",\"游戏\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他喜歡玩手機遊戲，差不多每天玩兩個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-12","sourceFront":"遊戲","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他玩遊戲贏了一萬塊錢，真幸運！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-15","sourceFront":"幸運","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"台灣的夜市很有特色，除了有各式各樣的小吃，還有不少好玩的遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-13","sourceFront":"各式各樣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"陳老師為了引起學生的學習興趣，每次上課前都會準備一些有趣的遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-38","sourceFront":"引起","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了無線網路，就可以隨時隨地上網查資料、看影片，或是玩遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-35","sourceFront":"隨時隨地","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師把安養院社團的社員分成兩個小組，第一組陪老人唱歌， 第二組陪老人玩遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-21","sourceFront":"組","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我玩了整晚的手機遊戲，結果第二天差點被爸爸打一頓。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-49","sourceFront":"頓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孩子：我玩電腦遊戲玩得正高興，你為什麼不讓我繼續玩？爸爸：得了！你玩到眼睛都紅了。去外面運動運動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-59","sourceFront":"得了","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小寒特別喜愛射氣球遊戲，每次去逛夜市時總要完五、六回。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-05","sourceFront":"射","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-02\",\"背\",\"背\",\"背\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的背很疼，吃了藥還是不舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-05","sourceFront":"還是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"爸爸這幾天背很疼，看了兩次病了，還是不舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-04","sourceFront":"看病","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下課鐘還沒響，可是學生都把背包拿起來準備回家了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-26","sourceFront":"響","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們的成長經驗、教育背景都差不多，所以想法也很像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-22","sourceFront":"背景","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在古代的中國，只有有錢、有背景的人才可以去學校讀書。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-20","sourceFront":"只有","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"背包客為了解省交通費，經常搭別人的車到下一個地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-01","sourceFront":"背包客","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個我覺得最難忘的回憶應該是跟「第一次」相關的經驗，比如第一次戀愛、第一次當背包客等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-15","sourceFront":"難忘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統抵達新聞說明會的現場前，安全人員得先確認記者的資料，還得檢查他們的背包。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-01","sourceFront":"抵達","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"站在老闆背後的那個人已經通過了面試，明天就要來上班了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-04","sourceFront":"背後","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"「每個成功男人的背後，都有一個偉大的女人。」你覺