"chinese":"小王的閱讀報告寫得很精彩，連教授都在課堂上當面誇獎他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-44","sourceFront":"誇獎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-04\",\"演戏\",\"演戲\",\"演戏\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個明星演戲前都會先研究戲裡的人物、故事，最後才決定表演的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-04","sourceFront":"演戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我妹妹不但長得漂亮，身高也夠高，十六歲就有人找她演戲了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-22","sourceFront":"身高","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個明星很會演戲，演了幾年戲就開始當導演，沒想到第一部戲就成功了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-15","sourceFront":"導演","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個演員非常喜歡演戲，不管導演給他多麼難演的角色，他都願意試試看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-25","sourceFront":"多麼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"東賢演什麼像什麼，每部戲都演得非常好，觀眾對他的表現非常肯定","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-29","sourceFront":"肯定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"美美剛進模特兒公司時，有一位導演找她演戲，沒想到就讓她變成了有名的明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我昨天晚上做了一個夢，夢到跟我最喜歡的明星一同演戲，開心得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-07","sourceFront":"一同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個女演員演戲的樣子很自然，一點也不誇張，難怪導演很欣賞她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-12","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-2-01\",\"追求\",\"追求\",\"追求\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在追求夢想的路上，會遇到很困難的事情，只有不斷努力，才能完成夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-01","sourceFront":"追求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"追求學問就是要多用腦，不斷地學，不斷地問。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-04","sourceFront":"學問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我哥哥開朗活潑、高大英俊，難怪有很多女生追求他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-05","sourceFront":"英俊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不管追求夢想的路上有多辛苦，都是我們一輩子珍貴的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-13","sourceFront":"回憶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何小姐地個性溫柔，笑起來也很迷人，所以追求她的人很多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-30","sourceFront":"迷人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小在追求夢想的路上，別太在意別人說什麼，只要不斷地努力，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-31","sourceFront":"在意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"方小姐既活潑又漂亮，難怪不少男生想追求她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-24","sourceFront":"既","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小王追求祝小姐好幾年了，不過祝小姐一直只把她當好友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-42","sourceFront":"當","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果說能回到過去，我最想放下工作，追求自己的興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-33","sourceFront":"如果說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他告訴孩子不需要事事追求第一，但做任何事都必須盡力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-21","sourceFront":"盡力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 追(pursue) and 求(beg): 追求 means pursue, to seek, to aspire to."},{"key":"[\"B3L04-1-23\",\"終於\",\"終於\",\"终于\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"章先生一直想當律師，經過多年的努力，終於夢想成真了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-23","sourceFront":"終於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小韓一直受不了臭豆腐的味道，昨天終於克服了心理障礙，把臭豆腐吃下去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-26","sourceFront":"克服","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林小姐從小就希望有一家屬於自己的麵包店，今年終於夢想成真了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-16","sourceFront":"屬於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的漢字考試總是不及格，經過三個月努力地練習，終於及格了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-18","sourceFront":"及格","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我是金東賢的戲迷，今天終於看到他本人，實在太開心了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-09","sourceFront":"本人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李導演付出了十年的時間，終於拍出了一部好電影，得到大家的肯定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-18","sourceFront":"付出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他努力了三年，終於考上了最好的大學，他激動得流下了眼淚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-27","sourceFront":"眼淚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林伯伯透過網路、報紙，尋找三十年前因為戰爭而分開的家人，最後終於找到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-31","sourceFront":"尋找","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他靠自己的力量，經過了十年，終於完成了這個發明。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-01","sourceFront":"靠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當聽到周博士多年的研究終於有了成果時，所有員工都給他最大的掌聲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-17","sourceFront":"掌聲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過這次手術，得了重病的嬰兒終於順利地保住了生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-32","sourceFront":"保","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 終(end) and 於(at): 終於 means finally."},{"key":"[\"B3L04-2-29\",\"如意\",\"如意\",\"如意\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每年春節時，爸爸都會送隔壁鄰居一盒蘋果，祝他們每天都平安、如意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-29","sourceFront":"如意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我去參加朋友的婚禮，除了送紅包，還祝福他們事事如意、早生貴子、永遠幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-31","sourceFront":"早生貴子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"再過幾天就要過年了，在此願大家新年平安，事事如意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-55","sourceFront":"願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 如(if) and 意(thought): 如意 means as you wish."},{"key":"[\"B3L06-1-23\",\"球\",\"球\",\"球\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天下午學校有籃球比賽，我們去看吧！","pinyin":"Jīntiān xiàwǔ xuéxiào yǒu lánqiú bǐsài, wǒmen qù kàn ba!","english":"There is a basketball game at school this afternoon. Let’s go watch it!","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-13","sourceFront":"比賽","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我的興趣是運動，打網球、游泳，我都喜歡。","pinyin":"Wǒ de xìngqù shì yùndòng, dǎ wǎngqiú, yóuyǒng, wǒ dōu xǐhuān.","english":"My hobby is doing exercise. I like both tennis and swimming.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-01","sourceFront":"興趣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那個孩子很愛踢足球。","pinyin":"Nà ge háizi hěn ài tī zúqiú.","english":"That kid loves to play soccer very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-07","sourceFront":"踢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我弟弟喜歡打棒球，我想送他一個棒球。","pinyin":"Wǒ dìdi xǐhuān dǎ bàngqiú, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā yí ge bàngqiú.","english":"My younger brother likes playing baseball, I’d like to give him a baseball as a gift.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-05","sourceFront":"棒球","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我每個週末去學校打籃球。","pinyin":"Wǒ měi ge zhōumò qù xuéxiào dǎ lánqiú.","english":"I go to school to play basketball every weekend.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-04","sourceFront":"籃球","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我跟同學常常一起在學校打網球。","pinyin":"Wǒ gēn tóngxué chángcháng yìqǐ zài xuéxiào dǎ wǎngqiú.","english":"My classmates and I often play tennis together at the school.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-03","sourceFront":"球","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"打網球怎麼樣？中明說妳的網球打得很好，我們一起去打吧。","pinyin":"Dǎ wǎngqiú zěnmeyàng? Zhōngmíng shuō nǐ de wǎngqiú dǎ de hěn hǎo, wǒmen yìqǐ qù dǎ ba.","english":"How about playing tennis? Zhongming said you play it well. Let’s go play it together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 王(jade) bead takes the 求(seek) of eager hands → the 球(ball)."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-1-22\",\"限制\",\"限制\",\"限制\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"住在學校宿舍有一些限制，比如說晚上十點前必須回到宿舍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-22","sourceFront":"限制","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"參加籃球社的條件是跑步的速度得夠快，但是沒有身高的限制。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-30","sourceFront":"條件","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"出國旅遊的時候，能帶的現金是有限制的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-25","sourceFront":"現金","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座橋對車子的高度有限制，開大車的人要小心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-11","sourceFront":"高度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"搭飛機時，行李的重量是有限制的，大約一件25公斤。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-12","sourceFront":"重量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對科學家或藝術家來說，提供他們一個不受限制的工作環境是很重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-15","sourceFront":"限制","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他因為生活條件的限制，而放棄了出國留學的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-04","sourceFront":"放棄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條道路限制車速五十公里，你不能再加速了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-09","sourceFront":"加速","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Setting boundary 限(limit) markers to 制(system) control activity: 限制 means restrict, limit."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-2-11\",\"平价\",\"平價\",\"平价\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家餐廳的菜不僅平價，還很營養，常常中午十二點前舉客滿了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-11","sourceFront":"平價","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L12-2-20\",\"盡\",\"盡\",\"尽\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"學生：明天就要大學考試了，我很緊張，怕考不好。 老師：你是很優秀的學生，我相信只要盡自己的能力，好好發揮實力，一定沒問題的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-20","sourceFront":"盡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"做好環境保護的工作，是每個現代人應盡的責任。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-08","sourceFront":"責任","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"照顧還沒成年的孩子是父母應盡的責任，無論如何，既然生了就該養他、教導他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-25","sourceFront":"無論如何","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他告訴孩子不需要事事追求第一，但做任何事都必須盡力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-21","sourceFront":"盡力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Using a brush 聿(brush) over bright 灬(fire) to scrape every remnant from the 皿(dish) goes to the 盡(greatest extent)."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-1-08\",\"自动\",\"自動\",\"自动\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那家店的門是自動的，只要站到門前就會自動打開","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-08","sourceFront":"自動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這棟大樓有安全系統的設備，小偷進去就會自動發出警告的聲音通知警察。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-08","sourceFront":"自動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"自動化工廠不僅使生產速度更快，同時也能保證產品品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-46","sourceFront":"自動化","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L15-2-01\",\"拼图\",\"拼圖\",\"拼图\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個世界拼圖很難拼，得花好幾天才拼得成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-30","sourceFront":"拼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-19\",\"證件\",\"證件\",\"证件\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"您想辦簽證的話，請先準備好相關證件再來辦理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-19","sourceFront":"證件","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"想申請獎學金的話，得先影印你的證件，再把影本寄給學校。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-25","sourceFront":"影印","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"註了冊以後，新生要把相關證件各影印一份，交給學校。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-38","sourceFront":"各","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"警察亮出證件，叫那個正在吸毒的人乖乖把毒品交出來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-13","sourceFront":"亮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-41\",\"印章\",\"印章/圖章\",\"印章/图章\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"印章也叫圖章，華人常在重要的文件上使用印章。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-41","sourceFront":"印章","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"去郵局領包裹的時候，記得帶身分證、圖章還有通知單。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-01","sourceFront":"包裹","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-06\",\"华侨\",\"華僑\",\"华侨\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他是華僑，說中文時常帶點兒當地的口音。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-06","sourceFront":"華僑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"公公\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Repeating 公(public) twice for emphasis: 公公 means father-in-law."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"叔叔\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Repeating 叔(uncle) twice for emphasis: 叔叔 means uncle."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"奶茶\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"奶(milk) + 茶(tea) → 奶茶(milk tea)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"年年\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Repeating 年(year) twice for emphasis: 年年 means every year."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"普\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Multiple rays 並(combine) together beneath the morning 日(sun) to shine across the entire landscape → 普(widespread)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"碰到\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 碰(touch) and 到(go to): 碰到 means encounter, to bump into."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"置\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Unfurl the fishing 罒(net) in a 直(straight) line along the beach to 置(lay out)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"適應\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Making skills 適(match) what one 應(should) handle: 適應 means adapt to."}]}
